            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula los parámetros estadísticos solicitados (media, percentiles, mínimo y máximo) del número total de registros de condición por paciente.\n\n```sql\nWITH PatientConditionCounts AS (\n    SELECT\n        person_id,\n        COUNT(condition_occurrence_id) AS condition_count\n    FROM\n        `condition_occurrence`\n    GROUP BY\n        person_id\n)\nSELECT\n    CAST(AVG(condition_count) AS FLOAT64) AS mean_condition_records,\n    MIN(condition_count) AS min_condition_records,\n    MAX(condition_count) AS max_condition_records,\n    CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(condition_count, 4)[OFFSET(1)] AS FLOAT64) AS percentile_25_condition_records,\n    CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(condition_count, 4)[OFFSET(2)] AS FLOAT64) AS percentile_50_condition_records,\n    CAST(APPROX_QUANTILES(condition_count, 4)[OFFSET(3)] AS FLOAT64) AS percentile_75_condition_records\nFROM\n    PatientConditionCounts;\n```",
